  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Peel the banana, break it into about six pieces, and place them in a freezer bag in the freezer overnight.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the rest of the ingredients except for the ice cubes to your blender container, put on the top, and refrigerate overnight.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "In the morning, add the frozen banana and ice cubes to the blender and puree until smooth. Enjoy right away.",
